2. Public Song Catalog Metadata & User Sheet Music
--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
The catalog files (`data/worship.db` and `resources/seed_songs.json`) contain
only public factual bibliographic and musical metadata (song titles, composers/
authors, key signatures, time signatures, BPM, scripture/season tags, and
non-expressive structural labels) and contain NO full lyrics, chord charts,
or copyrighted sheet music images.

All underlying musical compositions, lyrics, and any user-provided or locally
stored sheet music files (e.g., files under `sheet/` or `.worship-setlist/`)
remain the intellectual property of their respective copyright holders
(including KOMCA, CCLI, 한국찬송가공회, and original publishers/authors).
Users are responsible for maintaining appropriate worship/copyright licenses
(such as a CCLI Church Copyright License or publisher permission) before
printing, projecting, or sharing worship sheet packets.
